  "body": "Set on a generous 600m² section on Arran Drive, this beautifully designed 287.25m² home offers the perfect blend of space, comfort, and modern living in one of the most sought-after beachside suburbs. Featuring 4–5 bedrooms (including 3 master suites), 3 separate living areas, and 4.5 bathrooms, it’s an ideal choice for growing families or those needing flexible, extended living options.\r\n\r\nBuilt with quality and lifestyle in mind, this home delivers both style and practicality in every detail.\r\n\r\nSave time and money by dealing directly with the builders.\r\nContact Arup at Golstruct Homes on 021 777 155 to personalise this home to suit your needs.\r\n\r\nYour new home includes:\r\n\r\n4–5 spacious bedrooms with 3 separate living areas\r\n\r\n4.5 well-appointed bathrooms\r\n\r\n3 master bedrooms for ultimate comfort and flexibility\r\n\r\n10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n365-day maintenance period\r\n\r\nDouble glazing and full insulation\r\n\r\nPremium solution-dyed nylon carpets\r\n\r\nFloor-to-ceiling tiled bathrooms with tiled showers\r\n\r\nStylish glass balustrade\r\n\r\nDurable laminate flooring\r\n\r\nEngineered stone kitchen benchtops with soft-close cabinetry\r\n\r\nGenerous 2.7m stud height on the ground floor\r\n\r\nDucted air-conditioning system\r\n\r\nSecurity alarm system\r\n\r\nGas infinity hot water\r\n\r\nBosch stainless steel appliances\r\n\r\nCompleted patio, driveway, and pathways\r\n\r\nPlease note: Pricing excludes phone connection charges/levies (if applicable), window treatments.\r\n\r\nGet in touch:\r\nCall Arup on 021 777 155 at Golstruct Homes for more information, or visit our office at\r\n5–6 / 177 Millwater Parkway, Millwater.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a high-quality home in a prime coastal location—don’t miss it.",
